      "fine_trace_step": 9,
      "description": "When the final `.` selects embedded-IPv4 mode after 14 IPv6 bytes have already been written, this subtracts four bytes from `endp`, moving it to `mFields.m8 + 11` while `dst` is already `mFields.m8 + 13`. The fixing patch inserts `VerifyOrExit(dst <= endp, error = OT_ERROR_PARSE)` here; in the staged vulnerable source execution falls straight to the compaction loop with `dst > endp`."
    },
